  <data name="Contacts_FromGoogle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>1. On this PC, go to contacts.google.com and sign in.
2. Click Export.
3. Choose vCard (for iOS Contacts).
4. Click Export. The file lands in your Downloads folder.</value>
